// Strategy:
// - Instantiate T as long long to satisfy numeric_limits and comparisons.
// - Generate start/step from fuzzed values, enforce step != 0.
// - Pick a small N (#items to consume) to avoid unbounded iteration.
// - Constrain start so that iterating N elements cannot overflow signed range.
// - Iterate and assert arithmetic progression properties for coverage.
